                    <p>
                        The Fourth article in the Mesopotamian Influence edition of BET KANU Magazine explores the invention of writing — The revolution that changed human history. It examines how the Sumerians invented cuneiform writing, the stages of its development, and how it became a universal means of communication.
              </p>
